# DbDataBuild's conformance suite. The quick, apply and templates groups need SQL Server 2025 and PostgreSQL 17; the slow groups and
# the nightly full run add the engines below (`testenv/testenv.sh up mssql postgres mssql2025 oracle spark bigquery flight flight-tls`,
# or `up all`, which also starts the others). The suite reads the variables `env` prints (DBDATAKIT_TEST_MSSQL, _POSTGRES, _MSSQL2025, _ORACLE_KV,
# _SPARK, _BIGQUERY, _FLIGHT, _FLIGHT_TLS, _FLIGHT_TLS_CA), so there is nothing to add.
